------setup project------
git clone git@github.com:sunil-kumar987654433/webvory.git

-------------going into project-----
cd webvory

------create venv----into linux os-----
python3 -m venv venv


----activate venv------
source venv.bin/activate

-------------install package-----
pip install -r req.txt

-----install redis server in your linux os if you have linux os----
https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/install/archive/install-redis/install-redis-on-linux/

else
----according to your os select redis server----
https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/install/archive/install-redis/


----create database----
database credentials copy from .env file
------update in .env file----
REDIS_HOST=localhost
----run server , if you want to run project at local server-----
fastapi dev src/
--------------------------------------------




-----else---
----want to setup at docker run below 2 command , below create database and create table automatically----
change -->REDIS_HOST=redis
change hostname also in DATABASE_URL--> db
----


----- build and run docker use below command----
sudo docker compose up --build -d

-----for close ----docker----
sudo docker compose down




-----if you want delete volume also----then use below command----
sudo docker compose down -v
